definition:
Way of combining and shortening the two words 'emo goose', coming from a clip of an [among us character] playing soccer, with the audio saying "I see an emo goose". Everyone ([automatically] thinking it meant among us) made it popular. Can mean any and every word ever, but main meaning is just emo goose, among us, or a random chant you shout out. Most commonly used as a replacement of a curse word. There are many different variations of the word, too. Such as 'Elon moosk', referencing Elon Musk, but instead of Musk it's moose, and 'emo noose'.
[Pronunciation]:
//EE - maw - GOO - s//

It is the act of bringing your [crack dealer] to your family’s [thanksgiving dinner],;
Or
Making Whitey Bulger head of gaming in Los Vegas;
Or
Bringing a retarded girl you had sex with to [your grandmother]’s funeral and have her give the eulogy;
